-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions from part snap2 (merged by the lead on 2026-11-04; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- Cases for the seat layer of sections 2015, 2027 and 2029 of the Food and Nutrition Act of 2008 (snap2).
-- Each case states the facts a member of a household could state; the expected answer was decided from the text
-- (it is the expected value of the matching layer-1 assertion, written from the quoted words before the run, or is
-- written beside the case). The cases are not a second set of tests of the rules: they test that each question
-- is wired to its rule, that a stated answer reaches the rule, and that a case the text does not cover is NOTHING.

